re civil work starts, so electrical, plumbing and furniture plans are fixed early and nothing needs to be broken later.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Home That Grows With You</h2>\n            <p>Families change: children grow up, parents move in, work moves home. Good residential interior design plans for these changes from the start.</p><p>Planning a new home or renovation in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> to book a site visit.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}